{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208270","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208270","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1120827001:1":{"text":"잠깐만요… 하지만 조금 전에 집사에게 뱀독을 줬잖아요! 거미독을 줬으면 중화제를 어디서 찾으려 했던 거죠?","source_cn":"等等……但，你之前给执事的是蛇毒！如果给执事的是蜘蛛毒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C65E2147CD92FB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120827002:1":{"text":"걱정 마. 햄스터 아가씨! 뱀독과 거미독은 뭐… 거의 비슷한 효과거든. 그러니까 해독제를 찾는 방법도 비슷해.","source_cn":"不用担心，仓鼠小妹！蛇毒和蜘蛛毒起效的那个什么……反正...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x925CD2A6081F9566","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120827003:1":{"text":"하지만 거미독을 중화시키려면 양을 늘리고 잿물 같은 걸 섞어서 독성을 억제해야 해. 암튼 그래… 확실한 건 효과가 있다는 거야!","source_cn":"不过就是蜘蛛毒更烈，所以得加大剂量，还得再添上些碱水之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3788F8B4B408748","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1120827003":{"text":"하지만 거미독을 중화시키려면 양을 늘리고 잿물 같은 걸 섞어서 독성을 억제해야 해. 암튼 그래… 확실한 건 효과가 있다는 거야!","source_cn":"不过就是蜘蛛毒更烈，所以得加大剂量，还得再添上些碱水之类的破坏毒性。大概就是这样那样……总之，保证有用！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3788F8B4B408748","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120827004:1":{"text":"그거야, 난 딱히 잘하는 것도 없고 총 살 돈도 없으니, 세일린워터 마을에서 살아남으려면 머리를 굴려야 했지.","source_cn":"我啊，没什么本事，也买不起枪，想在咸水镇讨生活，不就只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0280B3B8041EB09E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120827005:1":{"text":"거미독, 전갈독, 뱀독… 이런 것들에 대해서는 다 섭렵했어.","source_cn":"蜘蛛毒、蝎毒、蛇毒……这些有用的好东西，我多少都知道点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBC6688538CD6911","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120827006:1":{"text":"아, 그리고 약초를 찾을 때는 조심해. 뭘 만날지 모르거든.","source_cn":"对了，找药草的时候可得小心点，咱们指不定会碰上什么呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1F23ABD3FBDB5C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1120827006":{"text":"아, 그리고 약초를 찾을 때는 조심해. 뭘 만날지 모르거든.","source_cn":"对了，找药草的时候可得小心点，咱们指不定会碰上什么呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1F23ABD3FBDB5C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120827007:1":{"text":"보면 알아! 어쨌든 <style=\"highlight\">밀크씨슬 열매</style>는 이 주변에 있으니까 잘 찾아봐.","source_cn":"看见了才能知道！总之<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAF79433573CE983","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"무슨 뜻이야?","source_cn":"什么意思？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x806F